Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of the material covered by this License (the "Licensed Material"), to use, copy, modify, adapt, and redistribute the Licensed Material, in whole or in part, for **non-commercial purposes**, subject to the conditions below.

This permission is intended to allow the community to freely use the Licensed Material as a starting point for their own projects, mods, total conversions, fixes, improvements, and derivative works.

## 2. Attribution

When the Licensed Material, or a substantial portion of it, is used or included in another project, the original creator must be credited.

The copyright notice and a reference to this License must be retained where reasonably practicable.

## 3. No Commercial Use

The Licensed Material, including modified or derivative versions of it, may **not** be used for commercial purposes or in connection with monetary compensation without prior written permission from the copyright holder.

For the purposes of this License, prohibited monetary or commercial use includes, but is not limited to:

* selling the Licensed Material or a derivative work;
* paid downloads;
* paid access to a project;
* Patreon or Ko-fi memberships or subscriptions;
* paid early-access or "early build" releases;
* donations or tips requested in connection with access to or distribution of the project;
* sponsorships or crowdfunding associated with the project;
* Nexus Donation Points or equivalent monetization systems;
* subscription-based distribution;
* using the Licensed Material in a commercial product or service;
* using the Licensed Material as part of a project whose distribution or access is conditional upon payment;
* using the Licensed Material for the purpose of obtaining monetary compensation from a third party.

The fact that payment is made to the project, its author, a team member, or another person or organization does not change this restriction.

## 4. Competitions and Monetary Prizes

The Licensed Material may **not** be used in, submitted to, or incorporated into a project entered into a competition, contest, challenge, modding competition, or similar event where the project may receive:

* a monetary prize;
* monetary compensation;
* a cash award;
* a financial grant;
* or another form of financial reward.

This restriction applies regardless of whether the participant must pay an entry fee.

Participation in such an event requires prior written permission from the copyright holder.

## 5. Free Distribution

Non-commercial redistribution of the Licensed Material and derivative works is permitted provided that:

1. the material is provided free of charge;
2. the attribution requirements of this License are retained;
3. this License or a reference to it accompanies the redistributed material where reasonably practicable; and
4. the distributor does not impose a payment requirement for access to the Licensed Material.

A project may accept ordinary community contributions that are completely independent of access to the Licensed Material, provided that such contributions are not used as a condition for obtaining, accessing, or downloading the Licensed Material or a derivative work.

## 6. Modification and Derivative Works

You may modify, adapt, translate, improve, or otherwise create derivative works from the Licensed Material for non-commercial purposes.

You are not required to release your modifications under this License unless you choose to do so.

However, all use of the original Licensed Material and any portions derived from it remain subject to the restrictions in this License.

## 7. No Endorsement

Use of the Licensed Material does not grant permission to imply that the original creator endorses, sponsors, or is affiliated with a derivative project without prior written permission.

## 8. Separate Permission

The copyright holder may grant separate written permission for uses that are otherwise prohibited by this License.

Such permission may be granted on a case-by-case basis.

## 9. Previously Licensed Material

This License applies to material released under this License.

Material that was previously released by the copyright holder under a different license remains subject to the terms of the license under which that material was previously released, unless a separate agreement provides otherwise.

## 10. Termination

Any rights granted under this License automatically terminate if you violate its terms.

Upon termination, you must cease exercising the permissions granted by this License and, where reasonably practicable, cease distributing the Licensed Material or derivative works that rely upon the permissions granted by this License.

